166
00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:56.940
My thoughts are usually in a documentary, the camera crew wants to disappear.

167
00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:02.820
They want to really capture people's lives and they try not to like interfere too much.

168
00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:09.300
And so I would guess, and I think you probably have the answer, that they wanted it that way.

169
00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.700
They wanted it to really feel like a documentary.

170
00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:13.460
Yeah.

171
