00:46:11.720 --> 00:46:18.020
Number one, I wanted to know how did Steve and Rain get up on the roof and who all was up there with them?

1104
00:46:18.180 --> 00:46:20.400
Did they have to ride that thing that you and John rode?

1105
00:46:20.960 --> 00:46:21.360
Yes.

1106
00:46:21.540 --> 00:46:25.760
They had to use that big scissor lift and everyone had to wear a safety harness.

1107
00:46:26.320 --> 00:46:31.040
But here was something new that Kent added this season.

1108
00:46:31.500 --> 00:46:40.980
Kent hired some stunt guys to rig safety cable up on the roof of the stage so that if there was ever a time where the crew had to be up there to do lighting,

1109
00:46:41.240 --> 00:46:46.240
they would be able to wear a safety harness and clip themselves onto a safety cable.

1110
00:46:46.240 --> 00:46:53.020
So, for this scene, Steve and Rain and Randall, who was our cinematographer,

1111
00:46:53.340 --> 00:46:59.680
they all had safety harnesses underneath their costumes and they were clipped onto the safety cable as well.

1112
00:46:59.800 --> 00:47:09.320
So, that also probably involved the wardrobe department because she would have had to have made sure their suits were big enough to go over the safety harness.

1113
00:47:10.060 --> 00:47:10.700
Yes.

