00:48:02.580 --> 00:48:06.380
Oh, well, so guys, it was either take 11 or 12.

1125
00:48:06.380 --> 00:48:12.260
I guess by some miracle, it landed on the trampoline and it hit the car perfectly.

1126
00:48:12.260 --> 00:48:19.080
And I feel like Steve and Rain's expression like is real because they were like, oh, my God, we finally did it.

1127
00:48:20.260 --> 00:48:22.680
Well, do you know what this reminded me of, Angela?

