00:49:41.580 --> 00:49:42.080
Waffle Ball.

1155
00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:43.380
You're rubbing off on me.

1156
00:49:43.540 --> 00:49:44.180
I know.

1157
00:49:44.320 --> 00:49:45.300
I love it.

1158
00:49:45.580 --> 00:49:49.540
Two things before we leave the whole watermelon off the roof moment, Jenna.

