Apple is appel.

1228
00:52:59.240 --> 00:52:59.480
Oh.

1229
00:52:59.700 --> 00:53:05.140
Well, the French have related the apple and the potato in their language.

1230
00:53:05.140 --> 00:53:05.620
Okay.

1231
00:53:05.920 --> 00:53:11.760
And so perhaps, perhaps they, I don't know, they're onto something.

1232
00:53:12.000 --> 00:53:13.880
Perhaps Creed would do well in France.

