00:53:20.160 --> 00:53:21.260
And thump them.

1236
00:53:21.640 --> 00:53:32.720
Before we leave the whole Creed betting scene, at 12 minutes, 38 seconds, you can see Angela sitting at her desk, watching everyone and judging.

