00:53:58.640 --> 00:54:00.780
But that doesn't mean she's participating.

1248
00:54:01.140 --> 00:54:01.340
No.

1249
00:54:01.340 --> 00:54:05.620
She needs to know just enough to judge you, but not enough to be judged.

1250
00:54:06.540 --> 00:54:07.020
Correct.

